Did you see that?

16
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:49,350
What was that thing?

17
00:00:49,730 --> 00:00:50,130
I don't know.

18
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:51,520
I'm just glad we made it out.

19
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,520
Look, there's a police car.

20
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,520
Help!

21
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,520
Help!

22
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,520
Please, please stop!

23
00:00:55,520 --> 00:01:06,520
Howdy, ma'am.

24
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:08,140
What seems to be the problem?

25
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,080
Is this man bothering you?

26
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,160
Officer, officer.

27
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:14,400
There is like a witch creature back there.

28
00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:17,700
We tied her up, but she broke free and she was about to have us for dinner.

29
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,010
Okay, calm down.

30
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:20,970
Calm down.

31
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,330
Let me see your eyes, please.

32
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:25,650
Have you been drinking tonight, son?

33
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:27,370
We're telling the truth.

34
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:29,350
She's in there.

35
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:36,010
We suspected her being a kidnapper or a rapist, but it turns out she's an alien or something.

36
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:38,530
Okay, calm down.

37
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:39,490
Calm down.

38
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,470
Let me see your eyes, please.

39
00:01:42,270 --> 00:01:42,640
Seriously.

40
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:46,320
Are you going to help us out or not?

41
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:46,490
Okay.

42
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:49,450
Let's go have a look, shall we?

43
00:02:13,950 --> 00:02:14,510
Hello?

44
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:19,080
Is anyone in there?

45
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:19,340
Be careful.

46
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:20,680
She might be hiding.

47
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:32,480
It's perfectly safe.

48
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:32,990
There isn't anyone.

49
